{"audio": "james-05.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 161067, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2400, "text": "James, Chapter Five."}, {"start_ms": 2400, "end_ms": 7333, "text": "Go to now, ye rich men, weep and howl for your miseries that shall come upon you."}, {"start_ms": 7333, "end_ms": 11067, "text": "Your riches are corrupted, and your garments are motheaten."}, {"start_ms": 11067, "end_ms": 20000, "text": "Your gold and silver is cankered; and the rust of them shall be a witness against you, and shall eat your flesh as it were fire."}, {"start_ms": 20000, "end_ms": 23733, "text": "Ye have heaped treasure together for the last days."}, {"start_ms": 23733, "end_ms": 35067, "text": "Behold, the hire of the labourers who have reaped down your fields, which is of you kept back by fraud, crieth: and the cries of them which have reaped are entered into the ears of the Lord of sabaoth."}, {"start_ms": 35067, "end_ms": 41333, "text": "Ye have lived in pleasure on the earth, and been wanton; ye have nourished your hearts, as in a day of slaughter."}, {"start_ms": 41333, "end_ms": 45867, "text": "Ye have condemned and killed the just; and he doth not resist you."}, {"start_ms": 45867, "end_ms": 49867, "text": "Be patient therefore, brethren, unto the coming of the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 49867, "end_ms": 58133, "text": "Behold, the husbandman waiteth for the precious fruit of the earth, and hath long patience for it, until he receive the early and latter rain."}, {"start_ms": 58133, "end_ms": 64533, "text": "Be ye also patient; stablish your hearts: for the coming of the Lord draweth nigh."}, {"start_ms": 64533, "end_ms": 72533, "text": "Grudge not one against another, brethren, lest ye be condemned: behold, the judge standeth before the door."}, {"start_ms": 72533, "end_ms": 79200, "text": "Take, my brethren, the prophets, who have spoken in the name of the Lord, for an example of suffering affliction, and of patience."}, {"start_ms": 79200, "end_ms": 81333, "text": "Behold, we count them happy which endure."}, {"start_ms": 81333, "end_ms": 89067, "text": "Ye have heard of the patience of Job, and have seen the end of the Lord; that the Lord is very pitiful, and of tender mercy."}, {"start_ms": 89067, "end_ms": 100933, "text": "But above all things, my brethren, swear not, neither by heaven, neither by the earth, neither by any other oath: but let your yea be yea; and your nay, nay; lest ye fall into condemnation."}, {"start_ms": 100933, "end_ms": 102933, "text": "Is any among you afflicted?"}, {"start_ms": 102933, "end_ms": 103733, "text": "let him pray."}, {"start_ms": 103733, "end_ms": 105200, "text": "Is any merry?"}, {"start_ms": 105200, "end_ms": 106800, "text": "let him sing psalms."}, {"start_ms": 106800, "end_ms": 108533, "text": "Is any sick among you?"}, {"start_ms": 108533, "end_ms": 122533, "text": "let him call for the elders of the church; and let them pray over him, anointing him with oil in the name of the Lord: And the prayer of faith shall save the sick, and the Lord shall raise him up; and if he have committed sins, they shall be forgiven him."}, {"start_ms": 122533, "end_ms": 128267, "text": "Confess your faults one to another, and pray one for another, that ye may be healed."}, {"start_ms": 128267, "end_ms": 133067, "text": "The effectual fervent prayer of a righteous man availeth much."}, {"start_ms": 133067, "end_ms": 142800, "text": "Elias was a man subject to like passions as we are, and he prayed earnestly that it might not rain: and it rained not on the earth by the space of three years and six months."}, {"start_ms": 142800, "end_ms": 147467, "text": "And he prayed again, and the heaven gave rain, and the earth brought forth her fruit."}, {"start_ms": 147467, "end_ms": 161067, "text": "Brethren, if any of you do err from the truth, and one convert him; Let him know, that he which converteth the sinner from the error of his way shall save a soul from death, and shall hide a multitude of sins."}], "words": [{"t": "James,", "s": 807, "e": 1271, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1553, "e": 1855, "si": 0}, {"t": "Five.", "s": 1916, "e": 2299, "si": 0}, {"t": "Go", "s": 2861, "e": 2941, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 3062, "e": 3162, "si": 1}, {"t": "now,", "s": 3222, "e": 3463, "si": 1}, {"t": "ye", "s": 3543, "e": 3623, "si": 1}, {"t": "rich", "s": 3723, "e": 3924, "si": 1}, {"t": "men,", "s": 3984, "e": 4205, "si": 1}, {"t": "weep", "s": 4506, "e": 4726, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 4786, "e": 4887, "si": 1}, {"t": "howl", "s": 4927, "e": 5207, "si": 1}, {"t": "for", "s": 5308, "e": 5428, "si": 1}, {"t": "your", "s": 5468, "e": 5588, "si": 1}, {"t": "miseries", "s": 5629, "e": 6110, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 6150, "e": 6270, "si": 1}, {"t": "shall", "s": 6310, "e": 6471, "si": 1}, {"t": "come", "s": 6531, "e": 6711, "si": 1}, {"t": "upon", "s": 6731, "e": 7032, "si": 1}, {"t": "you.", "s": 7092, "e": 7233, "si": 1}, {"t": "Your", "s": 7815, "e": 7955, "si": 2}, {"t": "riches", "s": 8036, "e": 8377, "si": 2}, {"t": "are", "s": 8437, "e": 8538, "si": 2}, {"t": "corrupted,", "s": 8558, "e": 9100, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 9401, "e": 9501, "si": 2}, {"t": "your", "s": 9521, "e": 9642, "si": 2}, {"t": "garments", "s": 9702, "e": 10144, "si": 2}, {"t": "are", "s": 10184, "e": 10304, "si": 2}, {"t": "motheaten.", "s": 10324, "e": 10926, "si": 2}, {"t": "Your", "s": 12068, "e": 12189, "si": 3}, {"t": "gold", "s": 12229, "e": 12609, "si": 3}, {"t": "and", "s": 12709, "e": 12810, "si": 3}, {"t": "silver", "s": 12910, "e": 13310, "si": 3}, {"t": "is", "s": 13470, "e": 13571, "si": 3}, {"t": "cankered;", "s": 13651, "e": 14151, "si": 3}, {"t": "and", "s": 14792, "e": 14893, "si": 3}, {"t": "the", "s": 14893, "e": 14973, "si": 3}, {"t": "rust", "s": 15013, "e": 15273, "si": 3}, {"t": "of", "s": 15313, "e": 15373, "si": 3}, {"t": "them", "s": 15413, "e": 15594, "si": 3}, {"t": "shall", "s": 15674, "e": 15854, "si": 3}, {"t": "be", "s": 15894, "e": 15954, "si": 3}, {"t":